      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "53",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who hath believed our message? and to whom hath the arm of Jehovah been revealed? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he grew up before him as a tender plant, and as a root out of a dry ground: he hath no form nor comeliness; and when we see him, there is no beauty that we should desire him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He was despised, and rejected of men; a man of sorrows, and acquainted with grief: and as one from whom men hide their face he was despised; and we esteemed him not.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Surely he hath borne our griefs, and carried our sorrows; yet we did esteem him stricken, smitten of God, and afflicted. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But he was wounded for our transgressions, he was bruised for our iniquities; the chastisement of our peace was upon him; and with his stripes we are healed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All we like sheep have gone astray; we have turned every one to his own way; and Jehovah hath laid on him the iniquity of us all.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He was oppressed, yet when he was afflicted he opened not his mouth; as a lamb that is led to the slaughter, and as a sheep that before its shearers is dumb, so he opened not his mouth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "By oppression and judgment he was taken away; and as for his generation, who ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " considered that he was cut off out of the land of the living for the transgression of my people to whom the stroke ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they made his grave with the wicked, and with a rich man in his death; although he had done no violence, neither was any deceit in his mouth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet it pleased Jehovah to bruise him; he hath put him to grief: when thou shalt make his soul an offering for sin, he shall see ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " seed, he shall prolong his days, and the pleasure of Jehovah shall prosper in his hand. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall see of the travail of his soul, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " shall be satisfied: by the knowledge of himself shall my righteous servant justify many; and he shall bear their iniquities. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore will I divide him a portion with the great, and he shall divide the spoil with the strong; because he poured out his soul unto death, and was numbered with the transgressors: yet he bare the sin of many, and made intercession for the transgressors.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
